title: StartHomeroom
---
<<fade_in SceneTrigger>>
Casey: Hi class, sorry I'm a bit late. Let's get started with roll call.
Casey: Mia?
Mia: Here!
Casey: Michelle?
Michelle: Here!
Casey: Liam?
Liam: Prrrrresent!
** giggles **
Michelle: You're too much, Liam.
The roll call continues...
Casey: Sam?
...
Casey: Bella?
<<pan_camera PlayerCam 90 0>>
Sam: Sorry I'm late.
Casey: No worries, Sam. But please see me after class.
<<pan_camera PlayerCam -90 0>>
<<move_to Sam -7.4 1 -4.2 true>>
Liam: Oooh, someone's in trouble!
Casey: Liam, that's enough. Let's continue with roll call.
<<change_scene SceneTrigger "Day1_HomeroomEnd">>
===

title:AfterHomeroom
---
<<fade_in SceneTrigger>>
Casey: Annnd Tom, I saw you earlier. Alright everyone, go to class.
Sam: Sorry I was late again, Miss Casey.
Casey: You've been late a lot recently, Sam. Is everything okay? Don't you live next door?
Sam: Yeah, I'm a really slow walker.
Casey: Careful, one more tardy and I'll have to call your parents. Neither of us would be thrilled about that.
Sam: Yes, Miss Casey.
Casey: Alright, Sam. I won't hold you any longer.
<<pan_camera CutsceneCam 90 0>>
<<move_to Sam 5.8 1 -6.35 true>>
<<move_to Sam 9 1 2.3>>
<<pan_camera CutsceneCam -90 0>>
Casey: (I think my boss wanted me to help him with something. I should go check.)
<<resume_player_movement Player 2>>
<<activate_player_camera CameraHolder>>
===


